   "tags": "Technical • COMPUTER SCIENCE • +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>A <em>PN</em> flip-flop has following four operations:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"media/7f/7f3ed0afdd12466b58a8.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>The characteristic equation of the above flip-flop is</p>",
   "options": [
