  {
   "n": 5,
   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • COMPUTER SCIENCE • +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>To count a decimal number sequence from 0 to 512, we wish to design a counter. For this counter the number of flip-flops required are</p>",
   "options": [
    {
     "key": "A",
     "html": "9"
    },
    {
     "key": "B",
     "html": "10"
    },
    {
     "key": "C",
     "html": "11"
    },
    {
     "key": "D",
     "html": "8"
    }
   ],
   "answer": [
    "B"
   ],
   "natRange": null,
   "answerText": "B",
   "marks": {
    "pos": 1,
    "neg": 0.33
   },
   "solution": "<p>(b)<br />\nFrom 0 to (511)<sub>10</sub> total number of decimal numbers are 512, so for this count we require (29 = 512) 9 flip-flops.<br />\nHence, 9 + 1 = 10 flip-flops are required to count from 0 to 512.</p>"
  },
